<BLOCKQUOTE>
  <P>The CYCLADES network was the first to make the hosts responsible =
for the=20
  reliable delivery of data, rather than this being a centralized =
service of the=20
  network itself. Datagrams were exchanged on the network using =
transport=20
  protocols that do not guarantee reliable delivery, but only attempt=20
  best-effort. To empower the network leaves, the hosts, to perform=20
  error-correction, the network ensured end-to-end protocol =
transparency, a=20
  concept later to be known as the end-to-end principle =
.</P></BLOCKQUOTE>
